*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0032
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-04-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-10-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 753
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0032.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 CUST-AGE           PIC 9(3).
    *> CURRENT LEDGER BALANCE
    05 CURR-BAL           PIC 9(9)V99.
    05 ACCOUNT-TYPE       PIC X.
    *> BASE INTEREST RATE
    05 STD-RATE           PIC 9V9999.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> RATE AFTER BONUS
    05 BONUS-RATE         PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 2500-SENIOR-RATE
    PERFORM 2600-FIXED-DEP
    DISPLAY "BONUS-RATE=" BONUS-RATE
    STOP RUN.
2500-SENIOR-RATE.
    *> SENIOR SAVER BONUS - LIMIT 45 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF CUST-AGE >= 60 AND CURR-BAL >= 10000
        COMPUTE BONUS-RATE = STD-RATE + 0.0050
    ELSE
        MOVE STD-RATE TO BONUS-RATE
    END-IF.
2600-FIXED-DEP.
    *> FIXED DEPOSIT UPLIFT
    IF ACCOUNT-TYPE EQUAL TO 'F'
        COMPUTE BONUS-RATE = BONUS-RATE + 0.0010
    END-IF.
